  "description": {
    "en": "Kirschbaum Black Shark is an octagonal co-polyester string designed to maximize spin, precision and control for aggressive baseline players. As the shaped version of Pro Line Black, its eight-sided profile enhances ball bite and spin potential while maintaining a predictable and controlled response. It is especially popular in hybrid setups, where Black Shark is used in the mains for control and spin and paired with a softer, more powerful cross string. The 1.25 mm version emphasizes spin and responsiveness, while the 1.30 mm version offers greater durability and stability.",

    "zh": "Kirschbaum Black Shark 是一款采用八边形截面的共聚酯单丝球线，专为追求高旋转、精准控制和强咬球能力的底线型球员设计。作为 Pro Line Black 的异形版本，其八边形结构能够显著增强球线与网球之间的摩擦和旋转潜力，同时保持稳定、可预测的击球反馈。它也非常适合作为 Hybrid 混穿中的主线，与更柔和、更有力量的横线搭配。1.25毫米版本更强调旋转和响应；1.30毫米版本则更偏向耐久与稳定。"
  },

